{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"860204961300217856","content":"(if you have a full backstory/character sheet you could DM me, that would be much appreciated and help this process)","created_at":"2021-07-15T05:07:50.476000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865097305979748382","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"860204961300217856","content":"You awaken on a hill by the sea sitting under a tree. Looking around, you see that you are on the same piece of land where gallardias cottage is now, though there is no building or other signs of development. You look around to see Gallardia herself, though she looks younger than she does now. She offers you a cup of tea. \"Please, drink. How are you feeling?\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T05:13:27.142000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865098718058643487","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"860204961300217856","content":"Luard is speechless at first as he tries to recall what happened to him. He remembers being called to fight for the city, fighting with Seraxa, seeing a multiple headed goose, intense fire, and then... nothing. Luard feels nauseous for a moment as the all-too-familiar feeling of nothingness enter his body. He tries to hide it from the fae with a forced smile. \"All good, how about you?\" He assumes a nonchalant expression to distract his emotions, sitting down and taking a long sip of the tea.","created_at":"2021-07-15T05:17:31.844000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865099744413089822","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"860204961300217856","content":"She tilts her head. \"There's no need to lie to me, Luard. You died, it's perfectly reasonable to feel the way you do right now.\" She takes a sip from her tea as well. \"It's alright to be sad or empty. But your friends are there for you.\" She pauses, before turning her hands in the air. A small window opens in the world and you see a vision. You see, through Gallardia's eyes, as Seraxa takes her silver pilot wings and places them between the lifeless hands of your own body. You watch as Seraxa says, somewhat choked up, 'Luard, buddy, I know you have some wings of your own, but... you're our pilot, okay? We haven't even made our ship yet'. The window closes. \"They're going to do everything they can to get you back. But in order to do so, there's something you must do as well.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T05:24:14.008000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-15T05:24:17.463000Z","id":"865101431211556874","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"860204961300217856","content":"Luard feels something alien as he hears Seraxa's words, he desperately fights to hold back the tears but a couple fall through the corners of his eyes. He wipes them off with his cloak and turns to face Gallardia, his expression now serious and determined. The vision he just saw giving him a drive to come back alive. \"I shall not let them down. What do I have to do?\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T05:27:02.076000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865102136139710494","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"860204961300217856","content":"\"We have to make a deal.\" She says simply, sipping her tea. \"The specifics of the deal are to be negotiated, but be warned that the cost will not be light.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T05:28:37.356000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865102535774044170","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"860204961300217856","content":"Luard takes in a deep breath, he figured as much. \"Simple and easy is never the case in Empire City as I have come to know.\" Luard hears in his mind the sound of cawing ravens. \"What do you want from me?\" He asks with steel in his eyes.","created_at":"2021-07-15T05:29:58.899000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865102877788733461","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"860204961300217856","content":"She reaches a hand out to touch the side of Luard's head. \"May I?\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T05:30:40.425000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865103051961532427","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"860204961300217856","content":"Luard flinches back. \"What are you gonna do?\" He asks, fearful for his memories.","created_at":"2021-07-15T05:31:20.995000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865103222125363201","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"860204961300217856","content":"\"I merely wish to look. I will take nothing from you that you do not agree to.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T05:32:04.322000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865103403851579402","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"860204961300217856","content":"Luard gives a hesitant nod. \"Okay..\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T05:32:20.676000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865103472446013450","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"860204961300217856","content":"She smiles reassuringly and puts a hand to the side of your head. After only a minute or so, she pulls away. \"I see why you were so apprehensive. You have already given so much. Allow me to think for a moment.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T05:34:19.834000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865103972229578752","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"860204961300217856","content":"Luard grimaces at the phrase 'given so much'. He knew he gave something to the ravens, the blank parts of his life always gnawing at him. He just didn't know it was 'so much'. He slowly nods at Gallardia, \"I know I don't have much... But I'm willing to go to great lengths just to get back.\" He says before he let's silence reign around them.","created_at":"2021-07-15T05:36:25.934000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865104501131837501","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
