{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"860204961300217856","content":"After a moment, she looks to you. \"I have some ideas.\" she says. \"First, you could give me some of your years, some of your arcane knowledge, and the memory of some of your muscles.\" (age around 200 years, lose a spell of your choice, and lose one of your background proficiencies) \"Second, you could give one of your senses.\" (become deaf) \"Finally, you could give me your name in full. This would not merely be the accendental giving visitors sometimes fall into, but a full loss of your name.\" (Various different negative effects, to be fully determined by me if you choose this deal.) \"What will it be?\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T05:51:11.285000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865108214563471381","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
