{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"860204961300217856","content":"(aight lemme think on this for a bit, name loss seems most dangerous but is actually the most appropriate for what I want Luard's story to be, will think more)","created_at":"2021-07-15T05:54:02.051000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865108930808250379","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"860204961300217856","content":"Luard thinks on this for a while. Why would the fae want his name? What is in his name? Does his name still hold value even if there is no more memories to go with it? Is he still 'Luard Dragonheart' even? Who is he? No answers come to comfort his panicked mind. He hears nothing.","created_at":"2021-07-15T06:07:32.700000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-15T06:17:50.209000Z","id":"865112330915676170","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"860204961300217856","content":"Nothing except a small voice telling him to let go, to move on. This could be a chance to start again, a rebirth. He stupidly gave away his memories, there is no coming back from that. But this might be a chance to shed his past off, to become someone else, someone... new.","created_at":"2021-07-15T06:09:03.075000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865112709976293395","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"860204961300217856","content":"One thing still claws at the back of his mind however. A lesson he should never forget. \"If I give you my name, I ask to still be able to remember those who I met here in the city. I don't want to forget...\" Luard racks his brain for an appropriate word. \"My friends.. I'm willing to give something back in exchange for you not taking what's left from my memories.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T06:11:11.373000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-15T06:18:07.585000Z","id":"865113248097763348","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"860204961300217856","content":"She nods. \"Some of Your magic, then. Or the memory of your muscle. You give me that and the whole of your name, and I shall bring you back less no memories.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T06:42:10.183000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865121044510933002","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"860204961300217856","content":"Luard nods at this. The corners of his mouth twitching ever so slightly up. Losing his name may bring with a whole new world of craziness and difficulties, but with the endless possibilities of starting anew he feels excited. \"We have a deal.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T06:44:53.405000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865121729114013717","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
